{
  "id": "dmwbbmaw0j1xb",
  "name": "跟手返回",
  "tags": [
    "交互",
    "动画",
    "导航"
  ],
  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "移动端从屏幕左边缘向右滑，当前页跟手右移、后面一页从左侧露出并带视差缩放；滑过一半松手完成返回，不足则回弹；中途反向拖回从当前可见进度继续，不跳变。",
  "usage": "有明确上一页的详情页、设置子页；移动端或可触屏的窄容器，且平台没有可用的原生交互式返回。",
  "caution": "别在网页里接管浏览器后退（会和系统边缘手势打架）；桌面端用返回按钮和 Esc。三层以上嵌套改用面包屑。",
  "hint": "从手机左边缘往右拖，过半松手返回；反向拖回可取消。",
  "inspiration": "",
  "prompt": "【跟手返回】目标：移动端从左边缘右滑，当前页跟手右移、后面一页从左侧露出并视差缩放；过半完成返回，不足回弹，反向可取消。\n\n1) 结构：body 居中放 phone（卡片预览里 174×152、padding 3px、圆角 20px、深色边框；放大弹窗里 340×600、padding 4px、圆角 28px，用 @media (min-height:421px) 切换）> pages（relative、overflow:hidden、圆角 17/24px）。pages 里叠四层：.back（z-index 1，上一页内容，transform-origin:0 50%）、.front（z-index 3，当前页，box-shadow 一条左边缘投影）、.veil（z-index 2，盖在 back 上的 var(--ui-bg) 遮罩，opacity 从 0.30 到 0）、.edge（z-index 4，绝对定位左侧命中区：卡片 26px、弹窗 56px，touch-action:none）。\n\n2) 进度映射：pointerdown 在 edge 上，记 startX 与当前进度 p（读 front 的 matrix 第 5 项 / 容器宽）。pointermove 里 p = clamp((clientX - base)/W, 0, 1)，每帧直接写：front 的 translateX(p*W)；back 的 translateX(-(1-p)*0.30*W) scale(0.93 + 0.07*p)；veil 的 opacity = (1-p)*0.30。绝不写 transition；W 每次用 pages.getBoundingClientRect().width 现量（两种尺寸下都正确）。\n\n3) 松手判定：p ≥ 0.45 或 (vx > 0.5px/ms 且 p > 0.12) 完成；否则取消。完成：从当前 p 补完到 1（220ms，cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)），back 从当前视差补到 translateX(0) scale(1)，onfinish 写内联值并 cancel。取消：从当前 p 回 0（时长 max(200, p*300)），back 回到 translateX(-0.30W) scale(0.93)。\n\n4) 取消/反向/快速重复：反向拖回时 p 直接减小，两层同时回退，没有独立的「取消动画」；pointerdown 时先量 mid → cancel 旧动画 → apply(mid) → 再把 base 设为 clientX - mid*W，保证从可见状态继续。完成态（returned）与离场中（leaving）忽略新手势；旧动画的 onfinish 用计数/判等丢弃，避免把页面拉走。\n\n5) 非拖动入口：页面左上角「‹」返回按钮触发同一个 complete()，可键盘激活。桌面端不要接管系统手势与浏览器后退，改用返回按钮、面包屑或侧滑抽屉；这一条要在交付说明里写清楚。\n\n6) 无障碍与降级：prefers-reduced-motion 下完成/取消都直接落位；role=status 播报「已返回上一页」；取消后焦点与滚动位置保持不变；不要 scrollIntoView。\n\n7) 配色：只用 --ui-*。back 与 front 用 color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-text) 5%, var(--ui-surface))，手机边框 color-mix(text 82%, bg)，遮罩用 --ui-bg。\n\n8) 坑：\n   - back 必须用 scale 而不是改宽高，否则文字被压扁；veil 要盖在 back 之上、front 之下；transform-origin 设在左边，缩放才有视差感；拖动时禁止文本选中。\n   - **命中区必须「看得见」**：edge 不加视觉反馈时，26px 的窄条几乎没人找得到，鼠标根本试不出来。做法：edge:hover 时整条边缘垫一层 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent) 的高亮，配一条 2–4px 的品牌色竖条（默认 50% 不透明，hover 到 90%），cursor 用 grab/grabbing。\n   - **放大弹窗必须同步放大手机和命中区**：按弹窗尺寸（740×733）给 @media (min-height:421px)，手机 340×600、edge 56px、字号 15–16px、行高 46–48px。固定 174×152 在弹窗里只是个小方块，既看不清也没法用鼠标试。\n   - **两页都要有足够内容撑满手机**：每页 7–9 行（设置项 / 通知项），4 行会让 600px 高的手机下半截全空，看着像没做完。\n\n9) 自动演示：包在 !window.__uiInteractive 里。第一轮 cursor.at 左边缘 → 0.52 秒后 press → 每帧 tween 到 0.66 并 apply 同步 → release → complete() → 停 0.9 秒 → 滑回 0；第二轮拖到 0.34 再反向拖回 0.06 松手（取消回弹）；hide 后约 1.3 秒循环。注意 tween 的目标是 0–1 的比例，不是像素值。\n",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>跟手返回</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px;\n    background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);overflow:hidden;\n    font:13px/1.35 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}\n  .phone{position:relative;width:174px;height:100%;max-height:152px;padding:3px;\n    border-radius:20px;flex:0 0 auto;\n    background:var(--ui-text);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 82%,var(--ui-bg));\n    box-shadow:0 8px 24px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 20%,transparent)}\n  .pages{position:relative;height:100%;border-radius:17px;overflow:hidden;\n    background:var(--ui-surface);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 5%,var(--ui-surface))}\n  .page{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;will-change:transform;\n    background:var(--ui-surface);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 5%,var(--ui-surface))}\n  .back{z-index:1;transform-origin:0 50%}\n  .front{z-index:3;touch-action:pan-y;\n    box-shadow:-1px 0 0 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)}\n  .nav{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:24px;padding:0 6px;\n    border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 9%,transparent)}\n  .nav b{font-size:10px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.01em}\n  .nav .tag{margin-left:auto;font-size:8px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .bk{flex:0 0 auto;width:16px;height:16px;margin:0;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:5px;\n    background:transparent;color:var(--ui-brand);font:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:1;\n    cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    transition:background .16s ease,transform .12s ease}\n  .bk:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)}\n  .bk:active{transform:scale(.9)}\n  .bk:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-brand);outline-offset:1px}\n  .rows{flex:1 1 auto;min-height:0;padding:5px 6px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n  .r{flex:0 0 auto;height:26px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:0 7px;border-radius:7px;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));\n    border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n  .r span{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:550}\n  .r em{margin-left:auto;font-style:normal;font-size:8px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .sw{flex:0 0 auto;width:18px;height:10px;border-radius:999px;position:relative;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent)}\n  .sw.on{background:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .sw::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:1.5px;left:1.5px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--ui-bg);transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.6,1)}\n  .sw.on::after{transform:translateX(8px)}\n  .edge{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:26px;z-index:4;\n    cursor:grab;touch-action:none}\n  .edge:active{cursor:grabbing}\n  /* 鼠标靠近时整条边缘亮起来——不亮的话几乎没人找得到「从这儿拖」的命中区 */\n  .edge::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 0%,transparent);transition:background .18s ease}\n  .edge:hover::before{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent)}\n  .edge::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:36%;width:2px;height:28%;border-radius:2px;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 50%,transparent);opacity:.5}\n  .edge:hover::after{opacity:.9}\n  .veil{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;background:var(--ui-bg);opacity:0}\n  .sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n  .demo-cursor.sweeping{transition:none}\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:8px}\n    .phone{width:168px;max-height:158px}\n    .r{height:24px}\n    .nav{height:22px}\n    /* 卡片里只放前 4 行：加行后 158px 的手机装不下全部设置项，否则最后一行会被切成半截 */\n    .rows .r:nth-child(n+5){display:none}\n  }\n  /* 放大弹窗（740×733）：手机按竖屏比例撑开，左边缘命中区同比例加宽到 56px。\n     原来固定 174×152，在弹窗里是个小方块，既看不清也没法用鼠标试。 */\n  @media (min-height:421px){\n    body{padding:16px}\n    .phone{width:340px;max-height:600px;padding:4px;border-radius:28px}\n    .pages{border-radius:24px}\n    .nav{height:46px;padding:0 13px;gap:8px}\n    .nav b{font-size:16px}\n    .nav .tag{font-size:12px}\n    .bk{width:30px;height:30px;font-size:22px;border-radius:8px}\n    .rows{padding:10px 12px;gap:8px}\n    .r{height:48px;padding:0 12px;gap:10px;border-radius:10px}\n    .r span{font-size:15px}\n    .r em{font-size:12px}\n    .sw{width:32px;height:18px}\n    .sw::after{top:3px;left:3px;width:12px;height:12px}\n    .sw.on::after{transform:translateX(14px)}\n    .edge{width:56px}\n    .edge::before{border-radius:0 10px 10px 0}\n    .edge::after{width:4px;top:38%;height:24%;border-radius:3px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"phone\">\n  <div class=\"pages\">\n    <div class=\"page back\" id=\"back\">\n      <div class=\"nav\"><b>设置</b><span class=\"tag\">上一页</span></div>\n      <div class=\"rows\">\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>账号与安全</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>通知</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>隐私</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>通用</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>存储空间</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>辅助功能</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>关于本机</span><em>›</em></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"page front\" id=\"front\">\n      <div class=\"nav\">\n        <button class=\"bk\" type=\"button\" id=\"bk\" aria-label=\"返回上一页\">‹</button>\n        <b>通知</b>\n        <span class=\"tag\">右滑返回</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rows\">\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>允许通知</span><span class=\"sw on\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"允许通知\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>声音</span><span class=\"sw on\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"声音\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>角标</span><span class=\"sw\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"角标\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>免打扰 22:00–8:00</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>通知分组</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>横幅样式</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>锁屏显示</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>通知历史</span><em>›</em></div>\n        <div class=\"r\"><span>消息预览</span><em>›</em></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"veil\" id=\"veil\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"edge\" id=\"edge\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"左侧返回手势区\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sr\" id=\"live\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  \"use strict\";\n  var front = document.getElementById(\"front\");\n  var back = document.getElementById(\"back\");\n  var edge = document.getElementById(\"edge\");\n  var veil = document.getElementById(\"veil\");\n  var live = document.getElementById(\"live\");\n  var bk = document.getElementById(\"bk\");\n  var pages = document.querySelector(\".pages\");\n\n  var st = {p: 0, drag: false, base: 0, pid: null, anim: null, vx: 0, lastX: 0, lastT: 0, mode: \"idle\"};\n  var reduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n  var cursor = null, demoTimer = null;\n\n  function W(){ return pages.getBoundingClientRect().width || 168; }\n  function apply(p){\n    st.p = p;\n    front.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + (p * W()).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n    var bx = -(1 - p) * 0.30 * W();\n    var bs = 0.93 + 0.07 * p;\n    back.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + bx.toFixed(2) + \"px) scale(\" + bs.toFixed(4) + \")\";\n    veil.style.opacity = ((1 - p) * 0.30).toFixed(3);\n  }\n  function currentP(){\n    var t = getComputedStyle(front).transform;\n    if (!t || t === \"none\") return 0;\n    var m = t.match(/matrix\\(([^)]+)\\)/);\n    if (!m) return 0;\n    var x = parseFloat(m[1].split(\",\")[4]);\n    return isNaN(x) ? 0 : Math.max(0, Math.min(1, x / W()));\n  }\n  function reset(animate){\n    if (st.anim){ try{ st.anim.cancel(); }catch(e){} st.anim = null; }\n    if (!animate || reduced){ apply(0); st.mode = \"idle\"; return; }\n    var from = currentP();\n    /* front 与 back 一起从当前进度回到 0，时长按剩余距离给 */\n    var dur = Math.max(200, from * 300);\n    var fa = front.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + (from * W()) + \"px)\"},\n      {transform:\"translateX(0px)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur, easing: \"cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.24,1)\", fill: \"both\"});\n    var ba = back.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + (-(1 - from) * 0.30 * W()) + \"px) scale(\" + (0.93 + 0.07 * from) + \")\"},\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + (-0.30 * W()) + \"px) scale(0.93)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur, easing: \"cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.24,1)\", fill: \"both\"});\n    var va = veil.animate([{opacity: (1 - from) * 0.30}, {opacity: 0.30}], {duration: dur, easing: \"ease-out\", fill: \"both\"});\n    st.anim = {cancel: function(){ fa.cancel(); ba.cancel(); va.cancel(); }};\n    var finished = 0;\n    function done(){\n      finished++;\n      if (finished < 3) return;\n      try{ fa.cancel(); ba.cancel(); va.cancel(); }catch(e){}\n      apply(0);\n      st.anim = null;\n      st.mode = \"idle\";\n    }\n    fa.onfinish = done; ba.onfinish = done; va.onfinish = done;\n  }\n  function complete(){\n    if (st.mode === \"leaving\") return;\n    st.mode = \"leaving\";\n    if (st.anim){ try{ st.anim.cancel(); }catch(e){} st.anim = null; }\n    var from = currentP();\n    var dur = reduced ? 0 : Math.max(140, (1 - from) * 220);\n    var fa = front.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + (from * W()) + \"px)\"},\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + W() + \"px)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur, easing: \"cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)\", fill: \"both\"});\n    var ba = back.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateX(\" + (-(1 - from) * 0.30 * W()) + \"px) scale(\" + (0.93 + 0.07 * from) + \")\"},\n      {transform:\"translateX(0px) scale(1)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur, easing: \"cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)\", fill: \"both\"});\n    var va = veil.animate([{opacity: (1 - from) * 0.30}, {opacity: 0}], {duration: dur, easing: \"ease-out\", fill: \"both\"});\n    st.anim = {cancel: function(){ fa.cancel(); ba.cancel(); va.cancel(); }};\n    var n = 0;\n    function done(){\n      n++;\n      if (n < 3) return;\n      try{ fa.cancel(); ba.cancel(); va.cancel(); }catch(e){}\n      front.style.transform = \"translateX(\" + W() + \"px)\";\n      back.style.transform = \"translateX(0px) scale(1)\";\n      veil.style.opacity = \"0\";\n      st.p = 1; st.mode = \"returned\"; st.anim = null;\n      live.textContent = \"已返回上一页：设置\";\n    }\n    fa.onfinish = done; ba.onfinish = done; va.onfinish = done;\n  }\n\n  edge.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function(e){\n    if (e.pointerType === \"mouse\" && e.button !== 0) return;\n    if (st.mode === \"returned\" || st.mode === \"leaving\") return;\n    /* 中断接管：先量当前进度，再停掉旧动画，从可见状态继续而不是跳变 */\n    var mid = currentP();\n    if (st.anim){ try{ st.anim.cancel(); }catch(err){} st.anim = null; }\n    apply(mid);\n    st.drag = true; st.pid = e.pointerId;\n    st.p = mid;\n    st.base = e.clientX - st.p * W();\n    st.lastX = e.clientX; st.lastT = performance.now(); st.vx = 0;\n    st.mode = \"dragging\";\n    try{ edge.setPointerCapture(st.pid); }catch(err){}\n  });\n  edge.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", function(e){\n    if (!st.drag) return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var now = performance.now(), dt = now - st.lastT;\n    if (dt > 0){\n      st.vx = st.vx * 0.6 + ((e.clientX - st.lastX) / dt) * 0.4;\n      st.lastX = e.clientX; st.lastT = now;\n    }\n    /* 跟手：进度直接由指针位置算出，每一帧立即写入两层页面 */\n    var raw = (e.clientX - st.base) / W();\n    var p = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, raw));\n    var over = raw < 0 ? 0 : (raw > 1 ? 1 : raw);\n    apply(over);\n  });\n  function end(){\n    if (!st.drag) return;\n    st.drag = false;\n    if (st.pid !== null){ try{ edge.releasePointerCapture(st.pid); }catch(e){} st.pid = null; }\n    var p = currentP();\n    var v = st.vx;\n    st.vx = 0;\n    if (p >= 0.45 || (v > 0.5 && p > 0.12)) complete();\n    else { st.mode = \"idle\"; reset(true); }\n  }\n  edge.addEventListener(\"pointerup\", end);\n  edge.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\", function(){\n    if (!st.drag) return;\n    st.drag = false;\n    if (st.pid !== null){ try{ edge.releasePointerCapture(st.pid); }catch(e){} st.pid = null; }\n    st.mode = \"idle\";\n    reset(true);\n  });\n  bk.addEventListener(\"click\", function(){\n    if (st.mode === \"returned\" || st.mode === \"leaving\") return;\n    complete();\n  });\n\n  function tween(dur, from, to, onStep, done){\n    if (reduced){ onStep(to); if (done) done(); return; }\n    var t0 = performance.now();\n    function frame(t){\n      var p = Math.min(1, (t - t0) / dur);\n      var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 2.3);\n      onStep(from + (to - from) * e);\n      if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n      else if (done) done();\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  }\n  function wait(ms, fn){ demoTimer = setTimeout(fn, ms); }\n\n  function startDemo(){\n    if (st.mode !== \"idle\"){ wait(400, startDemo); return; }\n    if (typeof window.__uiDemoCursor !== \"function\") return;\n    var r = pages.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if (!r.width || !r.height){ wait(400, startDemo); return; }\n    if (!cursor) cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    if (!cursor || !cursor.el) return;\n    var y = r.top + r.height * 0.62;\n    var x0 = r.left + 7;\n    cursor.el.classList.add(\"show\");\n    cursor.at(x0, y);\n    wait(520, function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n      /* 第一轮：拖过一半后松手，完成返回。进度是 0–1 的比例，不是像素值 */\n      tween(560, 0, 0.66, function(p){\n        apply(p);\n        cursor.at(x0 + p * r.width, y);\n      }, function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n        complete();\n        wait(900, function(){\n          reset(true);\n          wait(520, function(){\n            /* 第二轮：拖到一半前反向拖回，松手取消 */\n            if (!cursor) return;\n            cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n            cursor.at(x0, y);\n            wait(480, function(){\n              cursor.press();\n              cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n              tween(420, 0, 0.34, function(p){\n                apply(p);\n                cursor.at(x0 + p * r.width, y);\n              }, function(){\n                tween(380, 0.34, 0.06, function(p){\n                  apply(p);\n                  cursor.at(x0 + p * r.width, y);\n                }, function(){\n                  cursor.release();\n                  cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n                  st.mode = \"idle\";\n                  reset(true);\n                  wait(680, function(){\n                    cursor.hide();\n                    wait(1300, startDemo);\n                  });\n                });\n              });\n            });\n          });\n        });\n      });\n    });\n  }\n\n  apply(0);\n  if (!window.__uiInteractive){\n    demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 320);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n",
